------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- seL4 Debug Output
--
-- The debug kernel's console (`seL4_DebugPutChar`, CONFIG_PRINTING):
-- one character per call, no capability needed. Plan 0.127.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- | Print one character (the Int's low byte) on the kernel's console
signature putChar : Act Int Unit
